 "decision_policy": {
  "per_arm": "Pass iff for every paired seed: base normal median - jet2 normal median >= 4 deg, jet2 centre median <= 0.7 x base centre median, jet2 held-out PSNR >= base - 0.2 dB. Reject iff jet2 is worse than base on the normal median in every seed, or worse on the centre median in every seed. Else inconclusive. jet1 and the lambda arms are descriptive.",
  "predictions": "As stated in the PREREG (base regime 12-20 deg and 0.4-0.6 h; jet2 < 8 deg, centre median halved, PSNR within -0.2 dB in every seed; jet1 larger 90 % angle than jet2; operator accuracy jet2 < base (deferred); lambda 1.0 over-smooths, 0.01 between). Each is marked right/wrong in the RESULT.",
  "consequence": "No default promotion.",
  "stopping": "Fixed steps; abort a cell on non-finite loss or CUDA OOM."
 },
