 },
 "training": {
  "configs": {
   "base": "15000 steps, gsplat-default densification 500-7500 every 100 (grad 2e-4, no absgrad, max 100000, opacity reset 3000), SH degree 1 (interval 1000), masks on, random background, ssim 0.2, jet_lambda 0",
   "jet1": "base with jet_lambda 0.1, jet_order 1",
   "jet2": "base with jet_lambda 0.1, jet_order 2",
   "jet2_l001": "base with jet_lambda 0.01, jet_order 2",
   "jet2_l1": "base with jet_lambda 1.0, jet_order 2"
  },
  "jet_prior": "rtgs.optim.jet_prior.JetPrior(weight, order) passed to Trainer.train(jet_prior=...) per jet_prior_configs: k = 16 nearest centres refreshed every 50 steps and whenever densification changes the parameter tensors; h_i = mean distance to the 6 nearest; Gaussian weights; closed-form symmetric S_i (detached) with P_i(nu_j - nu_i) = S_i s_j; r_c uses the osculating paraboloid z = -1/2 s^T S s (the companion code convention, S = I/R on a sphere with outward normals; the PREREG's 'z_j - 1/2 s^T S s' with this S is a sign slip, resolved before outcomes); neighbour normals flipped into the hemisphere of nu_i; loss = lambda * mean_i(r_nu + r_c) over all splats.",
